Diane_energy_analysis.py

Estimates electricity consumption and CO2 emissions per LLM model on the
DIANE platform (DGFiP / ENSAE), using PDU power measurements and LiteLLM
usage logs stored on Onyxia / SSPCloud (S3/MinIO).

Energy measurement
------------------
  Dec 2025 : 80-min PDU snapshot -> average cluster power * uptime (3 scenarios)
  Feb 2026 : full-month cumulative PDU counter -> sum of diffs per circuit

Attribution corrections
-----------------------
  FIX 1  Quantisation   : q_i per dtype (FP8=0.50, MXFP4-MoE=0.339)
  FIX 2  MoE sparsity   : eff_params = non_MoE + (top_k/n_experts)*MoE_params
  FIX 3  Idle GPU power : 7% of cluster energy allocated by hosting days

HuggingFace model parameters
-----------------------------
  Priority: safetensors metadata -> config.json -> hardcoded fallback.
  MoE architecture and dtype also auto-detected from config.json.

Usage
-----
  python diane_energy_analysis.py
  python diane_energy_analysis.py --no-hf
  python diane_energy_analysis.py --no-export
  python diane_energy_analysis.py --hf-token hf_xxxxx
"""

